:: Study {"position":"275,25","size":"100,100"}
!! The Master’s Note
“The silver band measures the base liquid. Preparation matters. Order matters. And every failed potion teaches you something.” You copy the warning into your journal.

<<link "Open the Moonlight Elixir page" "Moonlight">><</link>>
